### 1. Register User Baru (Admin)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nama": "Meliza",
  "username": "mel_admin",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. Login User (Dapatkan Token)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "mel_admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Ambil Data Produk (Butuh Token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/produk
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 2|UZWYQ1TeXUELukqIh0rkY1UWgR4qmH1nbvHizZ3H66310580
